 SELECT · MODIFY 

 When your experiment stores traces in Unity Catalog , MLflow writes them to four tables in &lt;catalog&gt;.agent_deployment . The app's service principal needs Can select and modify on all four, or the app cannot write traces. 

 &lt;prefix&gt; _otel_spans One row per span: the call tree with timing, inputs and outputs 
