 &lt;prefix&gt; _otel_logs OpenTelemetry log records emitted while the app runs 
 &lt;prefix&gt; _otel_metrics OpenTelemetry metric data points recorded alongside traces 

 &lt;prefix&gt; defaults to the experiment ID. The steps are in the Apps UI card below. 







